[h1]HWMP Patch 2.4 - Field Test[/h1]
Shared fixes and original four races for Homeworld Remastered, based on the complete Players Patch 2.3Test build21. Use this standalone package by itself; do not add another Players Patch.

[h2]Changes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Owner-safe gravity wells, including tested new save/load cases; original permissions/speed are preserved.
[*] Support-frigate cargo recovery, per-ship capture/self-destruct permissions and independent stalled-docking timers.
[*] Refreshed Taiidan missile-defense selections and restored Vaygr Medium missile weapon-fire binding.
[*] Accepted Hgn/Vgr6/6 starting collectors and the Assault Frigate's final speed-accuracy node4 to1.2. Other broad balance coefficients are preserved.
[*] Native build/research tooltip translations for English, French, German, Italian, Spanish and Russian.
[/list]
[h2]Playtesting needed[/h2]
Two-client MP synchronization; normal/2x starts and languages; visible squadron repair; paid UI hyperspace/cancel and Guard return; full Hiigaran versus Vaygr matches with side/map swaps. Report release hashes and reproduction steps.

Old active-well saves made before the new journal are not guaranteed. Specific engine tests do not certify all campaigns or saved transport states. Consumer new races/campaign are separate projects.

[h2]Credits[/h2]
Players Patch team, Fear/Novaras, Test21 contributors and map authors. Code, engineering notes and frozen diagnostic examples: https://github.com/DmitryPrigodich/hwrm-mp-patch

Workshop release is a field-test candidate.
